{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"ini-cfg","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"INI and Properties","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for INI and Properties (.ini .cfg .properties .editorconfig).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"ini-cfg","name":"INI and Properties","extensions":[".ini",".cfg",".properties",".editorconfig",".desktop",".service",".conf"],"grammar":"grammars/ini-cfg.json","filenames":[".editorconfig","setup.cfg","tox.ini","pytest.ini"],"lineComment":";"}],"snippets":[{"language":"INI and Properties","path":"snippets/ini-cfg.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/ini-cfg.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \";.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s*\\\\[[^\\\\]]+\\\\]\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s*[A-Za-z0-9_.\\\\-]+(?=\\\\s*[=:])\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$\\\\{[^}]*\\\\}|%\\\\([^)]*\\\\)s\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|null|yes|off|no|on)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/ini-cfg.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Section\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sec\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"[${1:section}]\",\n      \"${2:key} = ${3:value}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A section\"\n  },\n  \"EditorConfig\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ec\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"root = true\",\n      \"\",\n      \"[*]\",\n      \"indent_style = space\",\n      \"indent_size = ${1:2}\",\n      \"end_of_line = lf\",\n      \"insert_final_newline = true\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A basic .editorconfig\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# INI and Properties\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for INI and Properties.\n\n## Files\n\n`.ini`, `.cfg`, `.properties`, `.editorconfig`, `.desktop`, `.service`, `.conf`, `.editorconfig`, `setup.cfg`, `tox.ini`, `pytest.ini`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `;`.\n- 2 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `sec` | A section |\n| `ec` | A basic .editorconfig |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}